{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:f4cbfc58a683894a66b028420969bb75a35fe4acda1bd3dce0024062c11b2041", "sample_idx": 11, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "\"To access the print version of the article, a link is provided. The rules for the Sudoku puzzle are explained, with a notable exception. The numbers in cells within grey lines must add up to the figures in the corner, which is an important detail to keep in mind. This variation on the classic game requires careful attention to the relationships between numbers in different areas of the puzzle.\"\n\n\n \nAddition to the standard Sudoku rules is the requirement that numbers within grey lines cannot be repeated. This means that players must think strategically about which numbers can be placed in each cell, taking into account the constraints imposed by the grey lines. The goal is to fill in all the cells with the correct numbers, while ensuring that each shape formed by grey lines contains a unique set of numbers.\n\n\n \nThe completed puzzle can be found in next week's Observer Digital Edition, which is available for purchase. This provides a convenient way for readers to check their work or simply enjoy the satisfaction of seeing the finished puzzle. The Observer Digital Edition offers a range of content, including news, features, and entertainment, making it a great resource for those who want to stay informed and engaged.\n\n\n \nThe rules of the Sudoku puzzle are designed to challenge and engage players, with the grey lines adding an extra layer of complexity. By requiring numbers to add up to the figures in the corner, the puzzle demands a combination of logical thinking and problem-solving skills. As players work through the puzzle, they must balance the need to fill in all the cells with the requirement to ensure that each shape contains a unique set of numbers.\n\n\n \nOverall, the Sudoku puzzle offers a fun and challenging way to exercise the mind, with the added twist of the grey lines providing an extra level of difficulty. By following the rules and using logical thinking, players can work their way through the puzzle and enjoy the sense of satisfaction that comes from completing it. Whether you're a seasoned Sudoku enthusiast or just looking for a new challenge, this puzzle is sure to provide hours of entertainment and mental stimulation.", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.3599557876586914}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305403679609299}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.01105328369885683}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.012234875932335854}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -4.005352093372494e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0024756519123911858}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011108341626822948}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.4765605926513672}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.004643965046852827}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.021684227511286736}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.016601981595158577}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.018153591081500053}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -0.00012361239350866526}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.4525010585784912}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.0027567262295633554}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.06940965354442596}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.012730992399156094}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.6356781125068665}, {"token": " Sudoku", "logprob": -0.03177499771118164}, {"token": " puzzle", "logprob": -0.000653530121780932}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.00026651646476238966}, {"token": " explained", "logprob": -0.41480597853660583}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.7762025890988298e-05}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.05835342034697533}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.011274909600615501}, {"token": " notable", "logprob": -1.8223836421966553}, {"token": " exception", "logprob": -0.0002531684876885265}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -1.4919565916061401}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.21284258365631104}, {"token": " numbers", "logprob": -0.124